            </span>
            <span className="text-xs text-slate-400">Penyegerakan Automatik 4-Hala</span>
          </div>
          <h2 className="text-xl sm:text-2xl font-black text-white mt-1 flex items-center gap-2.5">
            <Mail className="w-6 h-6 text-blue-400" />
            <span>Daftar Surat Masuk & Minit Tindakan (PO / PT / GB)</span>
          </h2>
        </div>

